 that contribute least to the overall likelihood.\n","\n","Where is it used?\n","\n","> SentencePiece supports Unigram and BPE tokenization. Some models, including T5 and several multilingual models, use Unigram-based tokenization.\n","\n","### Comparison of tokenization algorithms\n","\n","| Algorithm | Main mechanism                              | Example association     |\n","| --------- | ------------------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n","| BPE       | Repeatedly merges frequent pairs            | GPT-family tokenizers   |\n","| WordPiece | Selects merges using likelihood improvement | BERT                    |\n","| Unigram   | Starts large and removes less useful pieces | T5/SentencePiece models |\n","\n","## Vocabulary\n","\n","A vocabulary is a collection of all tokens that a tokenizer knows.\n","\n","Imagine a small vocabulary:\n","\n","| Token | Token ID |\n","|---|---:|\n","| . | 1 |\n","| The | 22 |\n","| cat | 24 |\n","| mat | 25 |\n","| the | 28 |\n","| was | 29 |\n","| it | 30 |\n","| on | 31 |\n","| sat | 32 |\n","| tired | 34 |\n","| because | 50 |"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":20,"id":"bdd2849c","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-11-08T03:54:15.890959Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-11-08T03:54:15.89058Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-11-08T03:54:15.895753Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-11-08T03:54:15.894884Z"},"papermill":{"duration":0.018417,"end_time":"2026-11-08T03:54:15.897733+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-11-08T03:54:15.879316+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"outputs":[{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":["Original text: The cat sat on the mat because it was tired.\n","Tokens: ['The', 'cat', 'sat', 'on', 'the', 'mat', 'because', 'it', 'was', 'tired', '.']\n","Token IDs: [22, 24, 32, 31, 28, 25, 50, 30, 29, 34, 1]\n"]}],"source":["print(\"Original text:\", text)\n","print(\"Tokens:\", tokens)\n","print(\"Token IDs:\", output.ids)"]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"87f9